# ─── Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A GCP service-account private key was tracked at netlify/functions/secrets/
# until 2026-09-04 (Investor AI blueprint D-9). That key is treated as
# compromised and must be rotated at the provider; this file prevents any
# credential from being committed again. Secrets are injected at runtime from
# the Netlify environment (FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY etc.), never from the tree.
netlify/functions/secrets/
gcp-secrets/
*.pem
*_rsa
*_rsa.pub
*PrivateKey*
*PRIVATE_KEY*
*.p12
*.pfx
*.key
.env
.env.*

# ─── Toolchain output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
cherry-viewer-dist/
.netlify/
npm-debug.log*
